#: ../../tools/humanmine_tools.rst:32 6a71688ac30d42baa98cac048990c2cd
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search HumanMine (InterMine) for genes, proteins, "
"pathways, diseases, and other biological entities related to human, "
"mouse, and rat. HumanMine integrates data from 30+ sources including NCBI"
" Gene, UniProt, Ensembl, GO, KEGG, Reactome, OMIM, and GWAS Catalog. "
"Returns entity IDs, types, names, symbols, and organism information. Use "
"the facet\\_Category parameter to filter results to a specific type "
"(Gene, Protein, Pathway, Disease, Publication, etc.)."
msgstr ""

